{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Finalize shutdown-time scope fatals before end-hook dispatch.** This post-close check can discover a scope fatal only after `onInvocationEnd` emitted `PENDING`/`SUCCEEDED` and plugin instances were released. The invocation then retries while Insight/OTel permanently retain a stale outcome. Settle scope cleanup before the single end dispatch and emit `RETRYING` with the fatal.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75uV47","finding_digest":"8be69537d7226d4ace1dfef289a46b28f9e5175206d90fffc1bd85e48ff10825","finding_id":"arf_v1_rptjkn6xejwuvtq573zitjdlfd","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-finalization-bypass","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-finalization-bypass","line":286,"observation_digest":"71a1cdf2ed158b66d7e5f2fe8ac543ba42a098b8633ea1813f9337f929631c50","observation_id":"aro_v1_ogq434xncwfwnv7f6l7ivrkdxj","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rptjkn6xejwuvtq573zitjdlfd","published_at":"2026-10-05T22:49:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_kfsnri6wu5y4d2bfhsye4jqsyn","reviewed_base_sha":"6045c38025275782197b771642129532058b8ccb","reviewed_head_sha":"189189e3465c03d341333907ed55587b989c9eb4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":286,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_6uwrhele3xeal2cmjnyfmtauv7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T22:49:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
